<title>UK: DSL unit sets 250 million mark bond.</title>
<headline>DSL unit sets 250 million mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DSL BANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.075   PAY DATE   S07.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    99.55     SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.525     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
